    "#WHY_WOULD_YOU_DO_THIS?": {
      "name": "Why Would You Do This?",
      "notes": "I want to know who made this cheap copy of my gun, so I can SHOOT them with it! Decreases the fire rate and damage of The Gun In Question by 30%."
